    {
      "id": "MWLfo7gWBGnzXkzOHgAb_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 399.3333443899787,
      "y": -213.0784882259639,
      "width": 693,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#2f9e44",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1445639761,
      "version": 397,
      "versionNonce": 1330385727,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777102938780,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "不管是大问题还是小问题,当这个问题足够困扰你的时候,你一定要解决它,想法\n就自然出现了,不管是改变 生活小难题 还是 改变整个大产业的革命",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "不管是大问题还是小问题,当这个问题足够困扰你的时候,你一定要解决它,想法\n就自然出现了,不管是改变 生活小难题 还是 改变整个大产业的革命",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "X5aqUL6Nld1thqoiijw7U",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 399.33334425482224,
      "y": -130.34452177071609,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#2f9e44",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 604505535,
      "version": 463,
      "versionNonce": 349023,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777102938780,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这个想法一定要是你自己的难点,从 first principle 思考解决方案,当你真的想改变它,\n就一定能改变, 如果它恰好同时是别人的难点, 那就能赚钱了",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这个想法一定要是你自己的难点,从 first principle 思考解决方案,当你真的想改变它,\n就一定能改变, 如果它恰好同时是别人的难点, 那就能赚钱了",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "C4iTTJcn6In_K4PZIXcP8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 399.33334449387564,
      "y": -36.11396752336083,
      "width": 564,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#2f9e44",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1534052497,
      "version": 235,
      "versionNonce": 601984895,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777102938780,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "用心做属于自己的 难点和产品,如果不满足这一点, 就不要去做",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "用心做属于自己的 难点和产品,如果不满足这一点, 就不要去做",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
